In addition to performing the duties specified in the city charter, the city attorney shall be the legal advisor and representative of the city and shall:
(1) Prepare or revise ordinances when so requested by the mayor, city council, or any committee thereof, review the Code of Ordinances of the city and assist in maintaining an up-to-date Code, properly indexed;
